ential developments across Delhi-NCR within the next four to five years. This strategy includes launching two new projects each year, targeting both luxury and multi-generational housing. Following recent successes with the Swaranaya project in South Delhi and another venture in Gurugram, Kreeva is also exploring options in Chandigarh and Lucknow, emphasizing ultra-luxury housing in chosen markets.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/industry/kreeva-plans-5000-crore-expansion-targets-two-residential-projects-annually/135266027?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-255028/135266027.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "industry"}]}